WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.820
I see money.

2
00:00:09.821 --> 00:00:18.128
There is a teller.

3
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:26.449
I see a computer.

4
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:34.780
There are customers.

5
00:00:34.781 --> 00:00:43.108
I see a guard.

6
00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:51.419
There is a big safe.

7
00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:59.297
I see a cash machine.

8
00:00:59.298 --> 00:01:06.508
Where am I?

9
00:01:06.509 --> 00:01:15.107
I am at a bank.

